+  /// With nil, for a window whose title bar is not known, by a guess. Of places that are as good as each other by the guess, the one that is
+  /// best whichever of the heights that were measured is the window's own: by the order of the places alone a window with a toolbar went
+  /// to a corner where fifteen rows of it showed on the neighbour, and from there to the other.
   func parkingOrigin(for size: CGSize, titleBar: CGFloat?, on display: DisplaySnapshot) -> CGPoint {
